The i d x _ 3 8 c 0 4 f c b payments service was enhanced in the same way as the orders service, combining Prometheus metrics with its
existing OpenTelemetry tracing. A counter (payments_requests_total) tracks the number of payment requests,
while a histogram (payments_request_seconds) records their latency. Each /pay call increments the counter and
